# Repo-root build context for the Next.js images (they are npm workspaces).
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/dist
**/target
.git
.env
.env*.local
*.log
backend
migration
infra
docs
safety-backups
**/*.md
# Legal texts of the website are markdown rendered at runtime — they must reach the image.
!site/content/**/*.md
